CHAPTER III
PRINCIPLES AND OBJECTIVES
Article 3
Protection of women and children from acts of violence and discrimination is conducted based on the principles of:
a. respect for human rights;
b. justice and gender equality;
c. non-discrimination;
d. victim protection;
e. empowerment; and
f. integration.

Article 28
(1) In order to achieve the objectives of protection of women and children from acts of violence as referred to in Article 3, the Regional Government cooperates with:
a. the Government;
b. the Provincial Government;
c. other Regency/City Governments; and
d. non-governmental institutions.
(2) Cooperation as referred to in paragraph (1), includes:
a. provision of data and information;
b. rehabilitation of victims of acts of violence;
c. repatriation and social reintegration; and
d. provision of evidence and witnesses;
(3) Cooperation as referred to in paragraph (1) and paragraph (2) shall be implemented in accordance with the provisions of laws and regulations.

# BUPATI BELITUNG REGULATION
NUMBER 45 OF 2016

CONCERNING

AMENDMENT TO BUPATI BELITUNG REGULATION NUMBER 75 OF 2015 CONCERNING SECOND AMENDMENT TO BUPATI BELITUNG REGULATION NUMBER 50 OF 2014 CONCERNING REGIONAL REVENUE AND EXPENDITURE BUDGET FOR FISCAL YEAR 2015

WITH THE BLESSING OF GOD ALMIGHTY

BUPATI BELITUNG,

Considering : a. that to implement the provisions of Article 176 paragraph (1) of Law Number 32 of 2004 concerning Regional Government as amended several times, most recently by Law Number 12 of 2008 concerning Second Amendment to Law Number 32 of 2004 concerning Regional Government, and Article 136 paragraph (1) of Government Regulation Number 58 of 2005 concerning Regional Financial Management, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Amendment to the Regional Revenue and Expenditure Budget;

b. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, it is necessary to establish a Bupati Regulation concerning Amendment to Bupati Belitung Regulation Number 75 of 2015 concerning Second Amendment to Bupati Belitung Regulation Number 50 of 2014 concerning Regional Revenue and Expenditure Budget for Fiscal Year 2015;

