HAS DECIDED:

To establish : BUPATI REGULATION CONCERNING AMENDMENT TO BUPATI BELITUNG REGULATION NUMBER 75 OF 2015 CONCERNING SECOND AMENDMENT TO BUPATI BELITUNG REGULATION NUMBER 50 OF 2014 CONCERNING REGIONAL REVENUE AND EXPENDITURE BUDGET FOR FISCAL YEAR 2015.

